# CS101 — Module 10: Defensive Security, SOC, Digital Forensics, Incident Response & Log Fundamentals

## 0. Module Overview

Cybersecurity can broadly be divided into two major areas:

```text
                    Cybersecurity
                         |
              +----------+----------+
              |                     |
       Offensive Security     Defensive Security
              |                     |
        Attack / Test          Detect / Investigate
              |                     |
   Find vulnerabilities       Find suspicious activity
              |                     |
     Exploit in authorized    Respond / Recover
          environments
```

### Defensive Security

The primary objective of defensive security is to protect an organization's:

* Systems
* Networks
* Applications
* Users
* Data

from cyber threats by detecting, investigating, responding to, and recovering from security incidents.

The major topics covered in this module are:

```text
Defensive Security
       |
