# 31. Important Windows Event IDs

| Event ID | Meaning                              |
| -------: | ------------------------------------ |
| **4624** | Successful logon                     |
| **4625** | Failed logon                         |
| **4634** | Logoff                               |
| **4720** | User account created                 |
| **4722** | User account enabled                 |
| **4724** | Attempt to reset an account password |
