# Part 6 — Apache Web Access Logs

# 35. Apache Access Logs

Apache web servers record HTTP requests in access logs.

A THM lab may provide a log such as:

```text
/root/Rooms/logs/access.log
```

A common Apache access-log location on Debian/Ubuntu-based systems is:

```text
/var/log/apache2/access.log
```

The exact location can vary depending on the operating system and configuration.

